WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.433
Material selections and the selection sheet.

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:08.200
Open the estimate. Selections live on the estimate.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:18.400
The customer's picks. Add selections: field and border paver, wall block, caps, steps, coping, upgrades. Record approval when they sign.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:24.500
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
